    "innovation": "This paper systematically evaluates how elevation modulates the temporal stability of climate-growth relationships in *Picea crassifolia*, demonstrating that these responses are dynamic and non-stationary, particularly at mid-to-high elevations in the Qilian Mountains.",
    "kg_extraction_triplets": [
